OL,3,AIceland on track to reject EU
OL,4,Areferendum as counting nears end
OL,5,
OL,6,FIceland has voted against resuming
OL,7,Fmembership talks with the European
OL,8,FUnion, public broadcaster RUV has
OL,9,Freported, with just one constituency's
OL,10,Fvotes left to count.
OL,12,FIt reported that 52.5% of the 188,496
OL,13,Fvotes so far counted had rejected the
OL,14,Fgovernment's proposal, while 47.5% had
OL,15,Fsaid yes. Some 9,500 votes separated
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
